  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>With so many big ideas out there, it's natural for you to try out as many of them as possible.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Multiuniversal philosophy class feature</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Select a single multiuniversal philosophy that you have not selected in the past. You gain the benefits of that philosophy. Whenever you are given the opportunity to select another philosophy through the multiuniversal philosophy class feature, you may not select the philosophy selected through this feat.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You can gain this feat multiple times. Each time, select a new multiuniversal philosophy.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/ethermagic-feats#toc18\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
